<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Four Seasons started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Four Seasons started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Four Seasons Hotels Inc with a market outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- The New York Stock Exchange-traded shares added 5/8 to 25-7/8 in early Tuesday trade.</p>
